  "description": "Experience ultimate adventure with the 29\" Kent Flexor mountain bike. With its durable tig-welded steel full suspension frame and front suspension fork, the Kent Flexor offers a comfortable and smooth ride, on any terrain. The front and rear linear side pull brakes provide exceptional stopping power, giving you complete control on steep descents. Adjusting your ride to fit your comfort is a breeze with the quick release height adjustable saddle, allowing you to quickly customize your seated position. With 21 speeds and easy to use twist shifters, you can easily change gears for any incline or decline. The lightweight alloy wheels and massive 29\" knobby mountain bike tires provide ultimate traction and durability on nearly any surface, so you can tackle the tougher trails. Whether you're an experienced rider or a beginner, the Kent Flexor is the great option to explore the outdoors.",
